ng while your app delivers the product.",[471,475,476],{},[477,478],"span",{"id":479},"choose-your-builder",[481,482,484],"h2",{"id":483},"find-your-platform","Find your platform",[486,487,488,501],"table",{},[489,490,491],"thead",{},[492,493,494,498],"tr",{},[495,496,497],"th",{},"Platform",[495,499,500],{},"How to get started",[502,503,504,516],"tbody",{},[492,505,506,513],{},[507,508,509],"td",{},[510,511,512],"a",{"href":459},"Lovable",[507,514,515],{},"Understand how Vatly fits your Lovable app, prepare the account and secrets, and give Lovable's agent the integration brief.",[492,517,518,523],{},[507,519,520],{},[510,521,522],{"href":463},"Bolt.new",[507,524,525],{},"Connect Vatly to your existing Bolt app and backend, then have the agent build and test your checkout and billing flow.",[471,527,528],{},"The Lovable and Bolt guides describe custom integrations using Vatly's existing packages and API. They are not native payment connectors or endorsements by those platforms.",[471,530,531,534,537,540,543,546,549,552,555],{},[477,532],{"id":533},"choose-your-integration-approach",[477,535],{"id":536},"create-a-checkout-with-the-javascript-sdk",[477,538],{"id":539},"create-a-checkout",[477,541],{"id":542},"prepare-your-vatly-account",[477,544],{"id":545},"keep-credentials-on-the-server",[477,547],{"id":548},"verify-webhooks-before-granting-access",[477,550],{"id":551},"before-you-connect",[477,553],{"id":554},"test-before-publishing",[477,556],{"id":557},"documentation-for-your-agent",[481,559,561],{"id":560},"framework-packages","Framework packages",[471,563,564,565,567,568,570,571,573],{},"Using a framework rather than an app builder? Official ",[510,566,211],{"href":216}," and ",[510,569,409],{"href":414}," packages integrate Vatly with your application. Their installation, configuration and API guides live under ",[510,572,116],{"href":117},", alongside the SDKs and fluent packages, rather than being duplicated here.",[471,575,576],{},"These packages are in alpha. Every alpha release may include breaking changes. Pin exact versions during alpha.",[481,578,580],{"id":579},"connecting-another-app","Connecting another app?",[471,582,583,584,586],{},"Start with ",[510,585,26],{"href":27}," to understand what Vatly handles, what your app needs, and what to ask your developer or agent to build. It also helps you choose a fluent package, SDK, or direct API approach.",[471,588,589,590,592,593,596,597,599],{},"If you are ready for your first API request, follow the ",[510,591,14],{"href":15},". Implementation examples live in the ",[510,594,595],{"href":117},"package docs",", with exact endpoint and field details in the ",[510,598,280],{"href":64},".",{"title":601,"searchDepth":602,"depth":602,"links":603},"",2,[604,605,606],{"id":483,"depth":602,"text":484},{"id":560,"depth":602,"text":561},{"id":579,"depth":602,"text":580},"Find platform-specific guides for using Vatly as merchant of record. Connect your Lovable or Bolt app and take the next step toward your first test purchase.","md",null,{},true,{"title":451,"description":607},"3mKQQ51EZijppG-SWpQWt_03ug8HbvS3FANDewRApRE",[615,617],{"title":363,"path":448,"stem":449,"description":616,"children":-1},"Set up the repository, run checks and build the Django package locally.",{"title":458,"path":459,"stem":460,"description":618,"children":-1},"Sell European software and digital products from Lovable with Vatly handling tax and invoicing. Start with a test API key and a copy-paste integration prompt.",1794524501224]